  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Enforces negotiated SMPP roles and bind modes, correlates acknowledgements to written requests, and bounds handshake, multipart and notification backlogs. Adds SAR and 16-bit segmentation support, corrects PDU round trips and error framing, and exposes delivery report send and acknowledgement outcomes. See https://github.com/kirakosyan/smsgate/blob/v1.3.0/CHANGELOG.md.",
